1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 7=

15
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:26,670
It's nothing.

16
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,230
It seems to be a stray cat.

17
00:01:29,350 --> 00:01:30,200
Now that we have a lead,

18
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:31,560
let's set off tomorrow.

19
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:32,590
Yes.

20
00:01:34,790 --> 00:01:36,510
Things have been complicated
at the manor lately.

21
00:01:37,230 --> 00:01:38,000
Leave a few men behind

22
00:01:38,350 --> 00:01:39,720
to protect Her Ladyship in secret.

23
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,200
Your Lordship,

24
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,560
have you noticed

25
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:46,280
that you seem
to treat Her Ladyship differently?

26
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,030
What's so different?

27
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:50,430
Think about it.

28
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:51,760
These past few days,

29
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:54,200
you've shielded Her Ladyship
from the flames

30
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:57,030
and helped her uncover the truth.

31
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,560
Today, while protecting her,

32
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,200
you even suffered such injuries
at First Madam's hands.

33
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,640
But from what I've seen,

34
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,870
Her Ladyship is
kindhearted and virtuous.

35
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,400
Even when faced with

36
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,720
someone as cruel as First Madam,

37
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,200
she repays cruelty with kindness,

38
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:10,820
knows when to yield
to gain the upper hand,

39
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:11,920
and wins people over with reason.

40
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:13,120
Today,

41
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,150
she even put aside their past grievances

42
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,550
to save Young Master Bai.

43
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,710
Tell me,

44
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,320
how could Your Lordship

45
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:19,960
not give your heart

46
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:22,510
to a woman like her?

47
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,990
Do you even know

48
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:29,160
what it means to overstep your bounds?

49
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:30,670
Leave.

50
00:02:31,150 --> 00:02:31,510
Yes.

51
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,550
Cheng.

52
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,950
This sword is for you.

53
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,230
When I return victorious,

54
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:49,390
I'll take you hunting.

55
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,560
Marquis Jingyuan, Shen Guangyuan,

56
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,550
disobeyed military orders

57
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:55,230
and led his troops
into battle without authorization,

58
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,510
causing the deaths
of over ten thousand soldiers.

59
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:58,960
Let go of me!

60
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,080
Let me go!

61
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,320
I must uncover the truth about Father!

62
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,270
Let go of me!

63
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:07,990
Let go!

64
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,880
Let me take a look at your wound.

65
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,560
It's nothing serious.

66
00:03:40,870 --> 00:03:41,670
Is there anything else?

67
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:42,950
Yes.

68
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:43,920
There is.

69
00:03:45,030 --> 00:03:47,010
Last time you shielded me
from the flames,

70
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:49,390
your sword scabbard was damaged, right?

71
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,550
Sanqi told me

72
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,080
that scabbard

73
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,760
was handmade
for you by the late Marquis.

74
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,920
To repay you,

75
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,600
I've restored it for you.

76
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,880
How did you do it?

77
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,360
Something like this

78
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,000
should naturally be left

79
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,270
to someone trained in the field.

80
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,240
But this agarwood

81
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,680
was incredibly hard to find.

82
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,510
I searched the entire city

83
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:25,510
just to find this tiny piece.

84
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,860
You know,

85
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:29,640
I was extremely careful restoring it,

86
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:31,510
even more than
with my graduation project.

87
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:35,240
I even carefully matched

88
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,950
every pattern on the scabbard.

89
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,000
And there's more.

90
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,330
Look here.

91
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:43,710
I even engraved
your childhood nickname on it.

92
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:44,820
Cheng.

93
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:47,920
♪The years of unspoken feelings♪

94
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,950
So,

95
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,510
do you like

96
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,950
this gift?

97
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,020
♪The distance between our hearts♪

98
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:57,740
♪Is just right at this very moment♪

99
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,760
I'm glad you like it.

100
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:03,680
(How could Your Lordship)

101
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:06,390
(not fall in love
with someone like her?)

102
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:08,820
(Shen Manor)

103
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,000
Qian.

104
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,700
(Pei Qian, Steward of Qinghe Manor)

105
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,150
Have you lost your mind?

106
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,920
You're just an estate steward.

107
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:23,800
Without being summoned,

108
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,850
how dare you come here?

109
00:05:24,850 --> 00:05:25,660
I've run out of money.

110
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:26,510
I came to ask you for some.

111
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:28,390
Didn't I just take some money

112
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,350
from the estate accounts for you?

113
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:30,590
What good is that little money?

114
00:05:31,390 --> 00:05:32,800
Please let me off the hook.

115
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,720
I'm just an adopted daughter
of the Marquis's family.

116
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,560
When I helped Xiang manage the accounts,

117
00:05:36,830 --> 00:05:38,440
I could still take money
from the estate for you.

118
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,760
But now,

119
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,270
Xiang has lost her influence.

120
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,430
Control of the household

121
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,160
will most likely go

122
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,760
to Her Ladyship and Third Madam.

123
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,270
There's really nothing I can do.

124
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,590
In that case,

125
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,510
find a few capable men

126
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:50,390
to abduct them.

127
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:50,880
Abduct...

128
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:52,390
Kidnap them?

129
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:53,910
That's far too reckless.

130
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,950
We're not going to kill them.

131
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,350
We'll release them
once we get the money.

132
00:05:58,950 --> 00:06:00,000
All you need to do

133
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:00,950
is come up with an excuse

134
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:02,270
to lure them out of the manor.

135
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:08,640
Don't worry.

136
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,150
No one will blame you.

137
00:06:11,070 --> 00:06:11,470
But...

138
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:13,680
But they're still...

139
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,200
Don't forget.

140
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,560
That thing of yours

141
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:23,000
is still in my hands.

142
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,120
Please don't.

143
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:25,080
I'm begging you.

144
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:30,800
Fine.

145
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,680
I'll do it.

146
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,440
You two handled

147
00:06:38,630 --> 00:06:40,000
Bai's situation very well.

148
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:41,350
You deserve a reward.

149
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:42,680
Starting today,

150
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,150
this household management token

151
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,200
will be entrusted to you both.

152
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,120
From now on,

153
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,720
all affairs

154
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,710
within the manor

155
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:49,000
will be managed

156
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:50,270
by the two of you together.

157
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,680
These jewels

158
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,830
were left for you

159
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:53,640
by Xiang

160
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:54,640
before she departed.

161
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,760
I hope

162
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:57,710
you won't hold a grudge
against her anymore.

163
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,200
Oh my.

164
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:01,640
This...

165
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,270
We really couldn't accept such a gift.

166
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:07,000
But since Xiang is being so generous,

167
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,830
we'll

168
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,000
gladly accept it.

169
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,020
(Shen)

170
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,950
You two...

171
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:20,760
All right.

172
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,760
Now, on to more serious matters.

173
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,360
While reviewing the accounts recently,

174
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:25,150
I discovered

175
00:07:25,230 --> 00:07:26,510
some discrepancies

176
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:27,590
in Qinghe Manor's records.

177
00:07:28,070 --> 00:07:29,320
Since you're now managing the household,

178
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:30,680
the estate inspection

179
00:07:30,730 --> 00:07:31,840
will be something

180
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:33,320
you two undertake together.

181
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,310
Why didn't anyone mention

182
00:07:35,310 --> 00:07:36,440
a bonus?

183
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,040
More responsibility without a raise

184
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,710
means more work for the same pay.

185
00:07:40,750 --> 00:07:42,640
Half the money you recover

186
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,150
will go

187
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,910
into your personal funds.

188
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,280
- We'll leave right away.
- We'll leave right away.

189
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,220
- We won't waste a moment.
- We won't waste a moment.

190
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:58,760
Let's go.

191
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,660
Grandmother.

192
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:05,720
My sisters-in-law will be busy

193
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,510
inspecting the estate.

194
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:07,800
Why not

195
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,150
let me go with them?

196
00:08:09,750 --> 00:08:10,830
I can lend a hand.

197
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:11,680
Very well.

198
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,870
The three of you

199
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:13,800
can go together.

200
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:14,950
That way,

201
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:16,590
you can look out for one another.

202
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:25,460
(Qinghe Manor)

203
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,590
I've checked these several times,

204
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:34,400
but the accounts seem perfectly fine.

205
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:36,350
That's exactly why they're suspicious.

206
00:08:36,550 --> 00:08:37,270
It's almost as if someone

207
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:38,470
deliberately prepared them for us.

208
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,230
Going by the usual novel plot,

209
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:44,230
someone must have switched
the account books.

210
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,800
You can't go up there.

211
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:49,800
You can't come in.

212
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,760
I'm sorry, Yuyuan and Shutiao.

213
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,600
This man forced his way in.

214
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,830
I couldn't stop him.

215
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,080
Your Ladyship, Third Madam.

216
00:08:57,810 --> 00:08:58,670
Those account books you're holding

217
00:08:58,670 --> 00:08:59,350
are all fake.

218
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:00,160
The real ones

219
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,560
were switched
by the estate overseer long ago.

220
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:02,230
What?

221
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,830
Who are you?

222
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:07,670
How do you know

223
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:08,670
the account books were switched?

224
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:09,520
I'm Pei Qian,

225
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:11,090
the steward of Qinghe Manor.

226
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,750
The overseer has oppressed
the tenant farmers for years,

227
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:13,800
using falsified accounts

228
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:14,750
to deceive his superiors

229
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,680
and line his own pockets.

230
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:17,040
I couldn't stand it anymore,

231
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,160
so when he wasn't looking,

232
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:19,540
I switched the real account books
with the fake ones.

233
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,160
Where are the real account books now?

234
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,440
This matter involves many people.

235
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:23,560
I was afraid of arousing suspicion,

236
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:24,550
so I hid the real account books

237
00:09:24,550 --> 00:09:25,680
at the Earth God Temple
outside the estate.

238
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,950
I ask nothing in return.

239
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:30,800
I only beg Your Ladyship and Third Madam

240
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:33,440
to seek justice
for the hardworking tenant farmers.

241
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,350
Rest assured, Steward Pei.

242
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,950
Now that we're in charge here,

243
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,920
we'll get to the bottom of this.

244
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,320
(The body is still warm.)

245
00:10:16,990 --> 00:10:19,310
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

246
00:10:19,310 --> 00:10:26,510
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

247
00:10:26,510 --> 00:10:31,710
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

248
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:37,950
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

249
00:10:39,310 --> 00:10:44,390
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

250
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:50,870
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

251
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:55,510
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

252
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:17,630
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
